{
  "slug": "aws-serverless",
  "name": "Aws Serverless",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Design, build, deploy, test, and debug serverless applications with AWS Serverless services.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **7 skills**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (7): `api-gateway` (Build, manage, and operate APIs with Amazon API Gateway (REST, HTTP, and WebSocket)), `aws-lambda` (Design, build, deploy, test, and debug serverless applications with AWS Lambda), `aws-lambda-durable-functions` (Build resilient, long-running, multi-step applications with AWS Lambda durable functions with automatic state persistence, retry logic, and orchestration…), `aws-lambda-managed-instances` (Evaluate, configure, and migrate workloads to AWS Lambda Managed Instances (LMI)), `aws-lambda-microvms` (Build, run, debug, and operate applications on AWS Lambda MicroVMs — Firecracker-isolated, snapshot-resumable serverless compute environments that run…), `aws-serverless-deployment` (AWS SAM and AWS CDK deployment for serverless applications), `aws-step-functions` (Build workflows with AWS Step Functions state machines using the JSONata query language)\n- **Hooks** (1): `PostToolUse`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `aws-serverless-mcp`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install aws-serverless@claude-plugins-official` from `awslabs/agent-plugins` (`plugins/aws-serverless`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
